CI & CD are two different concepts and not one and the same.
Typical CI workflow includes below steps:-
  * Build
  * Test
  * Code Coverage
  * Docker image

Typical CD workflow includes below steps and occurs after the CI workflows gets executed succesfully:-
  * Deploy
  * Push Docker image to any Docker hosting platformt such as Docker Hub
